Improper Input Validation and SQL Injection The application accepts user input for tags and product details without sufficient validation, which can lead to SQL injection vulnerabilities if the input is not sanitized., Insecure Direct Object References and Information Exposure The application may expose sensitive data or allow unauthorized access to product information if proper access controls are not implemented, especially when handling product data.

